hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1572","Nasr bin Ali Al-Jahdhami and Bishr bin Muadh Al-Aqdi narrated to us, saying: Yazid bin Zurayi narrated to us, Khalid Al-Hadha narrated to us, on the authority of Abu Ma’shar, On the authority of Ibrahim, on the authority of Alqamah, on the authority of Abdullah bin Masoud, he said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “How strange among you are those who have dreams.” And the prohibition, then those who follow them, then those who follow them, and do not differ, lest your hearts differ, and beware of the cracks of the markets.”"
